'''Piety''' is the third highest level [[Prayer]] in ''[[Old School RuneScape]]''. It requires a [[Prayer]] level of 70 and [[Defence]] level of 70 to use. Piety gives a temporary 25% boost to a player's [[Defence]], a 23% boost to a player's [[Strength]], and a 20% boost to a player's [[Attack]].

To gain access to this prayer, players must complete the quest [[King's Ransom]] and the [[Knight Waves Training Grounds]] activity, along with having level 70 [[Defence]] and 70 [[Prayer]].

Other than its several uses in Defence and [[Melee]] combat, it is also a requirement to have this prayer unlocked for completion of both the [[Morytania Diary#Hard|Morytania Hard Diary]] and the [[Kandarin Diary#Hard|Kandarin Hard Diary]].

